Eventually you'll polymorph (hopefully) into a teleporting monster (nymph,
leprechaun, tengu, unicorn, etc.); when you do, use the #monster (I think)
command to teleport. Or maybe it's the ^T command... keep trying... Also,
you *may* polymorph into something that can walk/eat through rock; *run*
do not walk to the nearest visible corridor/room if this happens.

